0 $4 $5 position (X,Y) of the second rounded end (center of the circle)*
0 Add line between two ends*
20,1,$1,$2,$3,$4,$5,0*
0 Add two circle primitives to create the rounded ends*
1,1,$1,$2,$3*
1,1,$1,$4,$5*%
